# Neon Doll Dark, a Plasma color scheme. Generated by tools/build-kde.py; edit that, not this.
#
# The window and the views are the page; the header, tooltips and
# alternate rows are the panel. Fuchsia is focus and hover, purple is
# links, and the selection is a fuchsia wash with ink on it.

